OL,3,ARainmakers: The drones used to seed
OL,4,Aclouds
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 23 August, Cooper Freeman had no
OL,7,Fidea clouds above his head were being
OL,8,Ffilled with a silver compound in order
OL,9,Fto cause rainfall.
OL,11,FNeither did thousands of other
OL,12,Fresidents in Homer, Alaska, who later
OL,13,Fdiscovered San Francisco start-up
OL,14,FRainmaker conducted an experiment in
OL,15,Fthat region using cloud-seeding
OL,16,Ftechnology.
OL,18,FThe company claims it produced 19
OL,19,Fmillion US gallons of water in the sky
OL,20,Fin three hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791391695
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARainmakers: The drones used to seed
OL,4,Aclouds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis approach to weather modification,
OL,7,Fnow more than 80-years-old, involves
OL,8,Fusing planes and drones to disperse
OL,9,Fcompounds such as silver iodide into
OL,10,Fclouds to form ice crystals. Those
OL,11,Fcrystals eventually become large enough
OL,12,Fto fall as rain or snow, depending on
OL,13,Fthe temperatures below.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
