OL,3,ABraid-creator Jonathan Blow on making
OL,4,Athe 'biggest puzzle game ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor ten years, Jonathan Blow has been
OL,7,Fworking with a small team on what he
OL,8,Fbelieves is "the biggest puzzle game
OL,9,Fever made".
OL,11,FThe American developer is renowned as
OL,12,Fone of the fathers of the modern indie
OL,13,Fgame movement, creating the
OL,14,Fgenre-defining puzzle-platformer Braid
OL,15,Fin 2008.
OL,17,FNow, a decade on from his last project,
OL,18,FThe Witness, The Order of the Sinking
OL,19,FStar is due to be released on Thursday
OL,20,F- a game with roughly 1,500 puzzles
OL,21,Fthat he estimates could take around 500
OL,22,Fhours to complete.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
